CM_ BO_ 1536 "PC to all boards. Only SCAN (MsgType 1) is accepted in broadcast.";
CM_ BO_ 1605 "PC to Dashboard (ESP32-S3): commands. MsgType 1 SCAN, 16 BEGIN, 17 CRC, 18 BLOCK_END, 19 FINISH, 20 ABORT, 21 ENTER_BOOT.";
CM_ BO_ 1733 "Dashboard (ESP32-S3) to PC: heartbeat, scan answers (INFO_A, INFO_B) and update answers.";
CM_ SG_ 1733 HwRevision "Hardware revision as an ASCII letter (65 = A, 66 = B).";
CM_ SG_ 1733 AckBlock "Number of the block confirmed (or refused) by the board.";
CM_ BO_ 1861 "File data for Dashboard (ESP32-S3): 8 raw bytes per frame, 32 frames per block of 256 bytes.";
